  m_Name: 14041204_NPCDlgNode_Seraphine_SanctumBriefing
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::FlameOfTheLost.NPCDialogueNodeData
  _id: 14041204
  _key: DIALOGUE_SERAPHINE_NODE_SANCTUM_BRIEFING
  _displayName: 
  _description: 
  _speakerName: Seraphine
  _dialogueSegments:
  - South of these crossroads, within the Whispering Grove, lies an entrance to the
    Forgotten Sanctum.
  - The ancients built sacred lanterns within such places. Their flames were more
    than sources of light; together, they could awaken the power sealed within a
    sanctuary.
  - To summon its guardian, you must carry a Light Source and ignite enough of the
    ancient lanterns. Once the required flames are burning, the seal will break.
  - But beware. What answers your call may no longer be the guardian it once was.
  _dialogueText: 'South of these crossroads, within the Whispering Grove, lies an
    entrance to the Forgotten Sanctum.

    The ancients built sacred lanterns within
    such places. Their flames were more than sources of light; together, they could
    awaken the power sealed within a sanctuary.

    To summon its guardian, you
    must carry a Light Source and ignite enough of the ancient lanterns. Once the
    required flames are burning, the seal will break.

    But beware. What answers
    your call may no longer be the guardian it once was.'
  _choices:
  - _choiceText: What awaits me in the Sanctum?
    _requirements: []
    _actions: []
    _nextNode: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5bb8da062ab2aa64bb19790b4fd8fb8d, type: 2}
  - _choiceText: How do I obtain a Light Source?
    _requirements: []
    _actions: []
    _nextNode: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5bb8da062ab2aa64bb19790b4fd8fb8d, type: 2}
  - _choiceText: That sounds dangerous. Farewell.
    _requirements: []
    _actions: []
